    body: `AUTHORIZATION TO RELEASE INFORMATION

Prepared: {{effectiveDate}}

{{#if returnInfo}}Federal law requires this consent form be provided to you. Unless authorized by law, {{firmName}} cannot disclose your tax return information to third parties for purposes other than the preparation and filing of your tax return without your consent. If you consent to the disclosure of your tax return information, Federal law may not protect your tax return information from further use or distribution.

You are not required to complete this form to engage {{firmName}}'s tax return preparation services. If {{firmName}} obtains your signature on this form by conditioning {{firmName}}'s tax return preparation services on your consent, your consent will not be valid. If you agree to the disclosure of your tax return information, your consent is valid for the amount of time that you specify. If you do not specify the duration of your consent, your consent is valid for one year from the date of signature.{{#if outsideUS}}

This consent to disclose may result in your tax return information being disclosed to a recipient located outside the United States. Your Social Security number will not be disclosed under this form.{{/if}}{{else}}{{firmName}} keeps your information confidential and will release it only as this form allows or the law requires. You are not required to sign this form to receive services from {{firmName}}.{{/if}}

I, {{clientName}}, authorize {{firmName}} to disclose the information described below to:

{{recipient}}{{#if recipientAddress}}
{{recipientAddress}}{{/if}}

INFORMATION THAT MAY BE SHARED
{{information}}

PURPOSE
{{purpose}}

DURATION
{{#if duration=date}}This authorization takes effect on the date I sign it below and expires on {{expires}}.{{/if}}{{#if duration=onetime}}This authorization takes effect on the date I sign it below and covers a single release of the information above, made within 90 days of the date I sign.{{/if}}{{#if duration=revoked}}This authorization takes effect on the date I sign it below and is valid for one year from that date.{{/if}}

MY CHOICES AND ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
This form authorizes disclosure only; it does not allow {{firmName}} to use my information for any other purpose. I may ask {{firmName}} to disclose less than the information listed above, as I direct. I may cancel this authorization at any time by written notice to {{firmName}}, except for information already released. {{firmName}} will not release anything before I have signed and dated this form, and will not change this form after I sign it. I will receive a copy of the signed form. This authorization covers only the information listed above and does not include my Social Security number or EIN unless listed. I ask that the recipient not pass the information on without my permission, and {{firmName}} is not responsible for how the recipient uses the information after it is released. This authorization does not allow {{firmName}} to act on my behalf before any tax authority.{{#if returnInfo}}

If you believe your tax return information has been disclosed or used improperly in a manner unauthorized by law or without your permission, you may contact the Treasury Inspector General for Tax Administration (TIGTA) by telephone at 1-800-366-4484, or by email at complaints@tigta.treas.gov.{{/if}}

{{clientName}}
Printed name and title (if signing for a business): ______________________________
Signature: ______________________________   Date: ______________
Spouse (joint return only): Signature: ______________________________   Date: ______________`,
